caption: Badges and Conduct

You should have already been issued a Starbucks Badge. This is important! If everyone in your party loses their badges, nobody gets paid for the job! Make sure the camera and mic are clear and recording at all times. This is how disputes about unexpected hazards, property damage, and client service complaints are resolved; the recorder is for your protection, so keep it on! Sabotage or intentional disabling of the Starbucks Badge is sufficient cause for forfeiture of mission rewards or possibly even removal of approved contractor status. While we are talking about no-nos, killing uninvolved civilians is utterly forbidden. We have a zero tolerance policy for non-sanctioned termination, so check your fire!
